{
  "_doc": "Plantillas de descripción de perks, objetos y consumibles (RT-035). El texto de un efecto NO se escribe a mano: se compone desde el propio dato con estas plantillas, así que descripción y efecto no pueden divergir. Marcadores: {trigger} {condition} {effects} {limit} {target} {who} {tag} {attribute} {duration} {probability} {counter} {value:+} {value:+%} {valuePerCounter:+} {maxValue} {counterDivisor} {ticks} {event} {n} {position} {zone} {detail} {a} {b}. Las claves de 'conditions' son el nombre de la función y, para las funciones que devuelven un número o texto, el nombre más el sufijo de la comparación (Lt, Le, Gt, Ge, Eq, Ne). Secciones del rediseño espacial (paquete S): 'links' nombra las relaciones direccionales de la ADR 0021 (marcador {link}), 'immunities' los efectos de tipo immunity, y 'startZones', 'startFlanks' y 'stats' los literales de las funciones startsIn, startsOn y stat (marcadores {startZone}, {startFlank}, {stat}, {cells}). Los valores porcentuales se escriben y se leen en puntos porcentuales enteros.",
  "layout": {
    "plain": "{trigger}, {effects}.",
    "withCondition": "{trigger}, {condition}, {effects}.",
    "withLimit": "{trigger}, {effects} ({limit}).",
    "withConditionAndLimit": "{trigger}, {condition}, {effects} ({limit}).",
    "effectSeparator": ", ",
    "effectFinalSeparator": " and ",
    "elsePrefix": "; otherwise, ",
    "linkSeparator": " and ",
    "lethalSuffix": " It marks one opponent per activation, whoever is worst off, and may kill them even if healthy.",
    "requiresSuffix": " Requires already carrying {count} perks from {family}.",
    "blocksSuffix": " Closes {blocked} for the rest of the run.",
    "blockedSeparator": ", ",
    "blockedFinalSeparator": " and "
  },
  "effects": {
    "modifyAttribute": "{target} {value:+} {attribute} for {duration}",
    "modifyAttributePerCounter": "{target} {valuePerCounter:+} {attribute} per {counter} (max {maxValue}) for {duration}",
    "modifyAttributePerCounterDivided": "{target} {valuePerCounter:+} {attribute} per {counterDivisor} {counter} (max {maxValue}) for {duration}",
    "modifyLeash": "{target} {value:+} leash for {duration}",
    "modifyBias": "referee bias {value:+}",
    "modifyProbability": "{target} adds {value:+%} to their {probability}",
    "cancelEvent": "cancels {event}",
    "addCounter": "+{value} to the {counter} counter",
    "setState": "{target} stays knocked down for longer",
    "modifyProbabilityPaired": "{probability} {value:+%} towards {target}",
    "modifyKnockdownTicks": "{target} leaves the opponent knocked down for longer with their tackles",
    "modifyKnockdownTicksDown": "{target} leaves the opponent knocked down for less time with their tackles",
    "immunity": "{target} {immunity}",
    "modifyExperience": "{target} gains {value:abs}% more experience",
    "modifyExperienceDown": "{target} gains {value:abs}% less experience",
    "modifyProbabilityPerCounter": "{target} adds {valuePerCounter:+%} to their {probability} per {counter} (max {maxValue:%})",
    "modifyProbabilityPerCounterDivided": "{target} adds {valuePerCounter:+%} to their {probability} per {counterDivisor} {counter} (max {maxValue:%})",
    "modifyLeashPerCounter": "{target} {valuePerCounter:+} leash per {counter} (max {maxValue}) for {duration}",
    "modifyLeashPerCounterDivided": "{target} {valuePerCounter:+} leash per {counterDivisor} {counter} (max {maxValue}) for {duration}"
  },
